ddler who has realized their arms are billy clubs. You gotta have nuance in how you build and approach your subject, work to create a reason to invest in it, and really try and dig into the reasons why it's <i>worth</i> talking about.<br /> <br /> As is, I agree with you and I am <i>still</i> inclined to just disagree with you because your approach basically asks me to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-08T14:43:40-07:00","id":1310815,"title":"","content":"Uhh I have to go to school to and that\u2019s why my Post is Undercooked but a lot of what people say the Greeks \u201cInvented\u201d Can not by Understated expect by me <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> but you can\u2019t deny the Iffy Race implications of saying Greece a \u201cWhite\u201d Cultures as the origins of Stuff like Logic, and democracy see Athenian Democracy lasting under a century Being a Direct democrac and not allowing Women, slaves and Metrics to join.<br /> <br /> Maybe Socrates was Greatly influenced by What we know call Black civilizations. and non of there records managed to survive. <br /> <br /> It\u2019s because people in the Renaissance found it and decided to Built the foundations of Society on it .","signature":"","edited":